#~ msgid "Discover Brussels — A Journey Through Europe’s Beating Heart"
#~ msgstr "探索布魯塞爾：暢遊歐洲活力中心"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Dive into the heart of Europe on a lively, all‑day coach adventure that "
#~ "blends postcard classics, hidden nooks, and a dash of Belgian indulgence. "
#~ "You’ll glide through town in a comfy, Wi‑Fi‑equipped bus while our "
#~ "storyteller‑guide sprinkles trivia, legends, and the occasional cheeky "
#~ "quiz (there are chocolate prizes!)."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "踏上這個生動有趣的全日巴士之旅，深入歐洲的中心腹地。這個精彩的旅程體驗，結"
#~ "合明信片經典美景及隱世有趣角落，並可一嚐比利時的奢華享受。你將乘坐配備 Wi-"
#~ "Fi 的舒適巴士，穿梭城鎮之間，細聽導遊講故事，在途上穿插各種趣聞、軼事、傳"
#~ "說，還偶有趣味問答考考你。（有巧克力獎品的哦！）"

#~ msgid "Expect:"
#~ msgstr "活動內容："

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Experience Belgium like never before with our expertly led group tours "
#~ "through <strong>Brussels, Antwerp, Ghent, and Namur</strong>. Whether "
#~ "you're traveling solo, with friends, or as part of a group, our guided "
#~ "tours offer the perfect balance of storytelling, sightseeing, and shared "
#~ "discovery."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "參加我們由專業導遊帶領的<strong>布魯塞爾、安特衛普、根特及那慕爾之旅</"
#~ "strong>，以前所未有的方式體驗比利時。無論你是獨自旅行、與朋友結伴遊覽，或"
#~ "參加旅行團，我們的導賞遊都十分適合，完美融合故事趣聞、觀光遊覽及探索體驗。"

#~ msgid "Explore Ghent - Medieval Majesty and Modern Cool"
#~ msgstr "探索根特：中世紀輝煌與現代時尚"

#~ msgid "Get an exclusive tour of the capital of the European Union"
#~ msgstr "獨特行程，讓你飽覽這座歐盟首府城市"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Ideal for families, solo travelers, curious locals, and organized groups, "
#~ "this tour is the perfect introduction to Namur. Whether you're here for "
#~ "the history, the views, or just the vibe — <strong>Namur will surprise "
#~ "you, and our bus tour will make sure you don’t miss a thing.</strong>"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "旅程非常適合家庭外遊、獨自旅行、組團遊覽，甚至想探索更多的本地人，是任何人"
#~ "認識那慕爾的完美起點。無論你想探索歷史、欣賞美景，還是純粹想感受當地氣氛，"
#~ "<strong>那慕爾都能夠為你送上驚喜，巴士行駛路線更確保你不會錯過任何精彩地方"
#~ "</strong>。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Join expert local guides for unforgettable walking tours through Belgium."
#~ "<br/>&amp;nbsp;Rich in history, full of charm, and never ordinary."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "跟隨本地專業導遊，踏上一次難忘的比利時步行遊覽。<br/>這座城市歷史悠久，魅"
#~ "力十足，絕非平平無奇。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Nestled at the meeting point of the Meuse and Sambre rivers, "
#~ "<strong>Namur is a city that whispers stories of centuries past while "
#~ "buzzing with the energy of modern Wallonia.</strong> Once a medieval "
#~ "stronghold and now the capital of the region, Namur offers a rich "
#~ "tapestry of history, culture, architecture, and natural beauty. And "
#~ "there’s no better way to discover it all than from the comfort of a "
#~ "guided bus tour designed to show you both the highlights and the hidden "
#~ "gems."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "那慕爾坐落在默茲河與桑布爾河的交匯處，這座城市<strong>散發着幾個世紀以來的"
#~ "歷史韻味，又充滿活力，洋溢現代瓦隆尼亞的朝氣</strong>。那慕爾曾是中世紀的"
#~ "要塞，如今是該區首府，擁有豐富的歷史、文化、建築及自然美景。要探索這座城"
#~ "市，最好的方式莫過於參加舒適的巴士觀光遊，帶你欣賞它的奪目景色，以及鮮為人"
#~ "知的隱世寶藏。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Our <strong>Antwerp Discovery Bus Tour</strong> invites you to explore "
#~ "the many layers of this fascinating city, from its medieval heart to its "
#~ "modern edge. Glide past the towering Cathedral of Our Lady and the "
#~ "vibrant Grote Markt, admire the intricate guild houses, and learn how a "
#~ "16th-century port grew into one of the world’s diamond capitals."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "我們的「<strong>安特衛普巴士探索之旅</strong>」誠邀你深入了解這座迷人的城"
#~ "市，揭開層層內涵，由中世紀的市中心，走到現代化的新發展區。巴士會帶你途經高"
#~ "聳入雲的聖母大教堂，以及車水馬龍、人潮如鯽的大市集，欣賞精緻的議會建築，了"
#~ "解這座 16 世紀的港口城市，如何逐步發展成世界其中一個鑽石之都。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Our <strong>Brussels Explorer Tour</strong> takes you on a rich and "
#~ "varied ride through the city's many faces — from the grandeur of the "
#~ "Royal Palace to the modern glass towers of the European Quarter, from "
#~ "medieval alleyways near the Grand-Place to the sprawling beauty of "
#~ "Cinquantenaire Park."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "我們的<strong>布魯塞爾探索之旅</strong>，會帶你欣賞這座城市豐富多彩的風"
#~ "貌：從宏偉的皇室宮殿，到歐洲區的現代化玻璃幕牆大樓，以至大市集廣場附近的中"
#~ "世紀懷舊小巷，還有獨立革命五十週年紀念公園的壯闊景色。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Our <strong>Ghent Highlights Bus Tour</strong> gives you a front-row seat "
#~ "to this city’s rich past and dynamic present. From the imposing Castle of "
#~ "the Counts to the shimmering St. Bavo’s Cathedral, from the industrial "
#~ "docklands reborn into cultural hubs to student-filled squares echoing "
#~ "with laughter and debate — Ghent is full of contrast, and endlessly "
#~ "fascinating."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "我們的<strong>根特市精華巴士遊</strong>，會帶你近距離感受這座城市的豐富歷"
#~ "史，以及現今的活力繁華。從宏偉的伯爵城堡，到閃閃生輝的聖巴夫大教堂；從舊工"
#~ "業碼頭改建重生的文藝氣息區域，以至學生喜愛流連、充滿歡笑聲及激烈辯論的廣"
#~ "場，根特都充滿精彩而強烈的對比，教人着迷。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Our <strong>Namur Discovery Tour</strong> invites you to sit back, relax, "
#~ "and enjoy a panoramic journey through the city’s most iconic sites and "
#~ "neighborhoods. Whether you're just visiting for the day or want to deepen "
#~ "your understanding of this fascinating city, our professional guide will "
#~ "bring Namur to life with engaging commentary, local anecdotes, and "
#~ "surprising facts."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "我們的<strong>發現那慕爾之旅</strong>，是你放鬆身心，環迴飽覽全市景觀之"
#~ "選，帶你欣賞最具代表性的地標及社區。無論你只是一日遊，還是想深入探索這座迷"
#~ "人城市，我們的專業導遊都會以生動的講解、當地趣聞，以及令人意想不到的冷知"
#~ "識，帶你認識那慕爾最真實一面。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Our guide will take you beyond the guidebook, sharing tales of medieval "
#~ "merchants, revolutionary thinkers, and contemporary innovators. You'll "
#~ "cruise past stunning architecture, lively street art, tranquil rivers, "
#~ "and bustling markets — all from the comfort of a modern coach with "
#~ "regular stops for photos and exploration."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "我們的導遊會帶你細看旅遊書籍不會提及的精彩地方，講述中世紀商人、革命思想家"
#~ "及當代創新人士的故事。你會乘坐舒適的現代化旅遊巴士，沿途欣賞令人嘆為觀止的"
#~ "建築、充滿活力的街頭藝術、恬靜悠閒的河流景緻，以及熙來攘往的熱鬧市集。巴士"
#~ "會定期停車或停站，方便你拍照及下車探索。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Our travel experts provide personalized itineraries to ensure "
#~ "unforgettable experiences."
#~ msgstr "我們的旅遊專家，為你提供個人化行程安排，確保你有非凡難忘體驗。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Using flexible planning, we deliver tailored travel solutions that adapt "
#~ "quickly to your preferences and feedback."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "我們採用靈活的規劃方式，提供量身設計的旅遊解決方案，能夠快速適應你的喜好及"
#~ "要求。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Walk alongside fellow travelers as our passionate guides bring each city "
#~ "to life — from medieval alleyways and majestic cathedrals to modern "
#~ "neighborhoods full of local flavor. Our groups are <strong>small enough "
#~ "to stay personal</strong>, but <strong>big enough to share laughs and "
#~ "moments</strong> you'll remember long after the tour ends."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "與其他旅客一同漫步，在熱情洋溢的導遊帶領下，感受每座城市的朝氣與活力：從中"
#~ "世紀的懷舊小巷及宏偉壯觀的大教堂，走到充滿本土風情的現代街區。導賞團規模適"
#~ "中，<strong>能讓你與同伴親切交流</strong>，<strong>同時又可分享團友的歡笑"
#~ "聲及珍貴時刻</strong>，為你留下難忘回憶。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "We are a team of passionate people whose goal is to improve everyone's "
#~ "life through disruptive products. We build great products to solve your "
#~ "business problems. Our products are designed for small to medium size "
#~ "companies willing to optimize their performance."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "我們是一群充滿激情的人，他們的目標是通過顛覆性的產品改善每個人的生活.我們"
#~ "打造出色的產品來解決您的業務問題.我們的產品專為願意優化其性能的中小型公司"
#~ "而設計."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "We focus on crafting personalized itineraries, ensuring memorable and "
#~ "high-quality travel experiences that meet your expectations."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "我們專注為你設計個人化行程，確保你有難忘、高質素的旅遊體驗，滿足你的期望。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "We prioritize safety measures at every stage, ensuring your travel "
#~ "experience is secure and worry-free."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "我們在不同階段，都始終將安全措施放在首位，確保你的旅行體驗安全無憂。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Welcome to <strong>Antwerp</strong>, Belgium’s bold, bustling port city "
#~ "where <strong>diamonds, design, and centuries of history</strong> sparkle "
#~ "side by side. As the country’s fashion capital and one of Europe’s most "
#~ "important trading hubs, Antwerp is a city that has always done things its "
#~ "own way — with flair, creativity, and confidence."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "歡迎光臨<strong>安特衛普</strong>，這座充滿活力、熙來攘往的比利時港口城"
#~ "市。在這裏，<strong>鑽石行業、時尚設計，與數百年的歷史</strong>互相輝映，"
#~ "一同發亮發光。作為比利時的時尚之都，以及歐洲其中一個最重要的貿易中心，安特"
#~ "衛普一直以自己獨特的風格、創意及自信，引領潮流。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Welcome to <strong>Brussels</strong>, the capital not only of Belgium, "
#~ "but of Europe itself. A city where history, politics, art, and chocolate "
#~ "all collide in a vibrant, multicultural atmosphere. With its iconic "
#~ "landmarks, whimsical architecture, grand squares, and quirky corners, "
#~ "Brussels is full of surprises — and there’s no better way to experience "
#~ "it all than from the comfort of a guided bus tour."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "歡迎光臨<strong>布魯塞爾</strong>，這裏不只是比利時首都那麼簡單，更是歐洲"
#~ "的經貿及文化首府。這座城市的歷史、政治、藝術──還有巧克力──都互相輝映，營造"
#~ "出充滿活力的多元文化氣氛。布魯塞爾擁有標誌性地標、奇特建築、宏偉的廣場，以"
#~ "及充滿個性的大街小巷，處處充滿驚喜。要體驗這一切，最佳方式莫過於參加舒適的"
#~ "巴士觀光遊。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Whether you're a history lover, an art enthusiast, a curious traveler, or "
#~ "just here for the vibes, <strong>Antwerp will impress you — and our bus "
#~ "tour makes sure you experience it all, effortlessly.</strong>"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "無論你是歷史迷、藝術愛好者、好奇的遊客，還是只是想感受一下市內氣氛，"
#~ "<strong>安特衛普都必定會為你留下深刻印象。同時，巴士遊的設計也會確保你能輕"
#~ "鬆體驗這一切。</strong>"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Whether you're enchanted by history, drawn to culture, or just here to "
#~ "soak in the vibe (and maybe a local beer), this tour is the ideal way to "
#~ "get oriented and inspired. <strong>Ghent is a city of stories — and we "
#~ "can’t wait to tell you some.</strong>"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "無論你是歷史迷、深愛各地文化的人，還是只是想感受市內動人氣氛的遊客（可能還"
#~ "順道品嚐一下本地啤酒），這個旅程都是了解這座城市、吸收靈感的好辦法。"
#~ "<strong>根特是充滿豐富歷史與故事的城市，我們十分期待與你分享當中的一些趣"
#~ "聞。</strong>"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Whether you're here for the first time or rediscovering the capital "
#~ "through new eyes, this tour offers the perfect balance of comfort, "
#~ "culture, and curiosity. <strong>Brussels is complex, beautiful, and alive "
#~ "— let us show you its heart.<br><br></strong>"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "無論你是初次到訪，還是想以全新的視角重新探索這個首都，我們的旅程都十分適"
#~ "合，為你帶來舒適享受、文化體驗及探索樂趣的完美平衡。<strong>布魯塞爾是錯綜"
#~ "複雜、美麗、活力澎湃的地方，讓我們帶你領略箇中精髓。</strong><br><br>"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "With expert commentary from a passionate guide, you’ll hear stories of "
#~ "Rubens and rock stars, shipping magnates and tailors, chocolatiers and "
#~ "revolutionaries. From the elegant Meir shopping street to the futuristic "
#~ "Port House, from hidden alleyways to grand plazas — this tour covers the "
#~ "full spectrum of Antwerp’s unique identity."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "在導遊的熱情、專業講解下，細聽魯本斯、搖滾明星、航運巨頭、裁縫、巧克力製造"
#~ "商，以至革命者的故事。從優雅的梅爾購物街，到充滿未來時代感的港口大廈，以至"
#~ "隱世小巷及宏偉的市集廣場，旅程將為你揭開安特衛普各方面的獨特風貌。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "You'll travel in style aboard a comfortable, air-conditioned coach, with "
#~ "plenty of opportunities to stop, snap photos, and soak up the atmosphere. "
#~ "And yes — we’ll give you a taste of something local on board. Think "
#~ "waffles, pralines, or maybe a fine Antwerpse Handje."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "你會乘坐舒適的空調旅遊巴，享受一段寫意旅程，沿途有眾多機會下車拍照，親身體"
#~ "會當地風情。還有，我們會在車上為你提供一些本地特色小食，例如窩夫餅、果仁"
#~ "糖，或一塊精緻的安特衛普手掌餅。"

#~ msgid "hello@mycompany.com"
#~ msgstr "hello@mycompany.com"
